guide forever/reputation/warsong-gulch
title Warsong Gulch Reputation
category Reputation
levels 10-60
zone Ashenvale
# Silverwing Sentinels (890, Alliance) and Warsong Outriders (889, Horde).
# Exalted with each battleground reputation is one of Forever's Legacy PvP
# Challenges (one account-wide Legacy Point each; official Legacy System news).
#
# From the Era-baseline reference data: the faction NPCs (Sentinel Farsong and
# Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale; Captain Shatterskull and
# Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Rampart, The Barrens), their mark turn-ins
# (Vanquish the Invaders! 7788/7871-7873/8291, Quell the Silverwing Usurpers
# 7789/7874-7876/8294, one per level bracket), the care packages (7863-7865,
# 7866-7868, one of the three) and the weekend Call to Arms quests at the
# Alliance Brigadier General / Horde Warbringer. Forever's Field of Honor season
# reworks PvP and may change marks, so the turn-ins stay notes until a live
# recording confirms them; the steps track the standing itself (rep 890/889).
# The battleground itself has no quest-giver steps: enter it from any
# battlemaster.

step Silverwing Sentinels to Friendly
  only Alliance
  tip The Silverwing Sentinels are the Night Elves holding Warsong Gulch. Their reputation comes from the battleground: every enemy flag your team captures pays it to the whole team. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  talk 14733 optional -- Sentinel Farsong, Silverwing Grove
  note Sentinel Farsong takes Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for Vanquish the Invaders!, once per level bracket (data); check them live.
  rep 890 Friendly

step Silverwing Sentinels to Honored
  only Alliance
  tip Keep playing Warsong Gulch and capturing flags. On Call to Arms: Warsong Gulch weekends the Alliance Brigadier General in the capitals takes three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for extra reputation.
  talk 14753 optional -- Illiyana Moonblaze hands out one Sentinel care package by level
  rep 890 Honored

step Silverwing Sentinels to Revered
  only Alliance
  tip Keep capturing flags in Warsong Gulch.
  rep 890 Revered

step Silverwing Sentinels to Exalted
  only Alliance
  tip Exalted with the Silverwing Sentinels earns a Legacy Point.
  rep 890 Exalted

step Warsong Outriders to Friendly
  only Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Warsong Outriders are the Orcs logging Ashenvale. Their reputation comes from the battleground: every enemy flag your team captures pays it to the whole team. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  talk 14781 optional -- Captain Shatterskull, Mor'shan Rampart
  note Captain Shatterskull takes Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for Quell the Silverwing Usurpers, once per level bracket (data); check them live.
  rep 889 Friendly

step Warsong Outriders to Honored
  only Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip Keep playing Warsong Gulch and capturing flags. On Call to Arms: Warsong Gulch weekends the Horde Warbringer in the capitals takes three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for extra reputation.
  talk 14754 optional -- Kelm Hargunth hands out one Outrider care package by level
  rep 889 Honored

step Warsong Outriders to Revered
  only Horde
  tip Keep capturing flags in Warsong Gulch.
  rep 889 Revered

step Warsong Outriders to Exalted
  only Horde
  tip Exalted with the Warsong Outriders earns a Legacy Point.
  rep 889 Exalted
